WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.350
Wait... Mizore!

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:06.690
You were seriously playing in 
the band <i>just</i> for Nozomi?!

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.350
You practiced so hard, you worked for 
the competition, and you got nothing?

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:12.740
Oumae-chan...

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.650
Yes?

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.240
Let's make it to the Nationals.

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.630
Horns, give me more of the full notes at L.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.730
Yes.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.730
Trombones, watch your rhythm 
on your accompaniment.

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:03.650
Yes.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:07.940
Euphoniums, as I said before, play the 
notes at F a little higher.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:08.600
Yes.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.500
Also...

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.270
Oumae-san.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.070
Yes?

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.780
Remember the way you played just now.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.320
Yes.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:22.340
All right, with everything in mind, 
let's take it from the top again.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.940
Pretend it's the real concert.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.080
I'll say it again.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.260
This is the concert.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.100
For the upcoming Kansai Competition,

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.790
please practice the parts that gave you trouble.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:37.480
I haven't forgotten that you 
said you could do it.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.880
<i>Since then, it's been a month.</i>

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:44.300
<i>Tomorrow is the day. The Kansai Competition.</i>

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:49.300
<i>Episode 5 
Miraculous Harmony</i>

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.400
Listen up, everyone.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:56.530
Tomorrow, don't overthink the performance.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:01.840
All we're doing tomorrow will be presenting 
everything we've worked on, as is.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.320
That's all.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:04.580
Yes.

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:10.080
Also, the two coaches I hired for the summer,

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.120
Hashimoto-sensei and Niiyama-sensei, 
will be done after today.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.090
A final word, please.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.550
It's only been three short weeks,

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.600
but I think your playing
has definitely improved.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:29.520
I, myself, had much to learn 
from your upright attitude.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:34.260
Stand tall and have fun tomorrow 
at the Kansai Competition!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.480
Um...

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.050
You know how I am, so I'll just be blunt.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:46.020
Kitauji is as good as the
best schools in Kansai.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.370
Have confidence!

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.600
You've become very expressive 
in the past three weeks.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.050
Especially Yoroizuka-san!

00:03:54.050 --> 00:03:54.580
Yes.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.850
You're like a whole new person.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.800
Did something good happen to you?

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:02.220
Yes.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.430
Sweet!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.940
Tomorrow, be like her.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.590
When you perform, be true to yourself.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:10.910
I'm looking forward to it!

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.690
Why are you crying?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.850
All stand.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.280
Thank you very much.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.300
Thank you very much.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.450
See you tomorrow.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.510
Bye.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.040
What's all this about?

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:34.750
This? I don't know.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.460
Doesn't it get you pumped up?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:41.080
I'm going to work harder on the tuba.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.510
Of course, I'll support you guys tomorrow.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.930
So you have to take me to the Nationals!

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:53.350
I talked to Natsuki-senpai about it, 
playing together next year.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:59.230
So you guys have to take me to the Nationals, 
and show me how awesome it is!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:03.400
Make us want to play there, as well.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.070
Hazuki-chan...

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.440
See you!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.460
The Nationals, huh?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.420
Yeah.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.400
We have to say it out loud.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.520
Like Hazuki-chan does.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.280
We're going to the Nationals.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.470
Yeah, we're going.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.680
To the Nationals.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.270
<b>Members: 85 
52nd Time in the Competition</b>

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.670
<i>All as one.</i>

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.440
<i>Osaka Toushou will be competing in</i>

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:46.260
<i>tomorrow's Kansai Concert Band Competition.</i>

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.640
Crap, I'm getting scared...

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.390
Hello, Azusa-chan?

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:02.430
Long time.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:03.450
Do you have time now?

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.500
I'm home.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.790
Yeah, I was just watching TV.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.430
I'll make dinner right away.

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.650
The news about Toushou, right?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.170
I was watching, too.

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.470
They're always so good.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:14.790
I hate to admit it, but yeah.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.550
Hey, is Rikka going in the morning?

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:19.120
Yeah. Seventh.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.330
What about your school?

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.160
Sixteenth. In the afternoon.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.260
Yeah?

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:26.070
I'll be done first, then.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.440
I guess so...

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:31.220
Hey.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:37.000
I want you to not talk to me tomorrow, 
even if you see me.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:40.940
I probably won't be thinking straight.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.420
All right.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.790
<i>The Concert Band Competition 
takes place once a year.</i>

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.850
<i>For that one competition,</i>

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:59.200
<i>we practiced without pause, in the morning, 
after school, during summer break.</i>

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:04.650
<i>Crying and sweating, until there 
was nothing left of us.</i>

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.250
<i>All for a twelve-minute performance.</i>

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:08.900
<b>National Concert Band Competition</b>

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:17.200
<i>Right now, I doubt there's even one 
person who's thinking straight.</i>

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.420
Senpai, I checked it out.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:31.930
How was it?

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:35.060
Three schools got gold, including Toushou.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.490
And...

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.850
Rikka High School got silver.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.630
Huh? No way!

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.720
I'm going to puke...

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:48.070
Hey, now, we don't have time to be 
thinking about the other schools.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.820
We need to focus on our performance now.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.820
Hey, over here!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.790
You're late.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.790
Sorry.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:57.530
This isn't like you, Azusa.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.220
What happened to your usual energy?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.670
Try to buck up.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:02.580
Yeah.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.490
Okay, stop.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.310
All right, why don't we take a deep breath?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.800
Breathe in deep...

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:24.560
Exhale, exhale, exhale...

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:27.890
Relax your emotions...

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.110
And smile.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:34.430
That's all I have to say.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.840
Of course.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.610
I mean, that's typical of him.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.410
President, would you like to say anything?

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:41.540
Sensei...

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.450
Yes, Tanaka-san?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.580
I'd like to say a little before the president.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.670
This time last year,

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:54.960
I don't think anyone could have 
imagined we'd be here today.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:58.910
Especially not the second- and third-years, 
with all that'd happened.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:03.190
Yet in just under six months, here we are.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:06.350
This is, without doubt, thanks to 
Taki-sensei's instruction.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:13.330
Let's reciprocate by enjoying 
our performance today!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.190
Yes.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:19.530
Also, if I'm honest about
how I feel right now,

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.990
I don't want to lose.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:26.250
I don't want to be done at saying, 
"I'm glad we made it to Kansai."

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.880
Now that we're here, I want 
to take the next step,

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.630
and let the whole nation hear Kitauji!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.930
So, everyone...

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:39.760
Let's give it everything we've built 
so far, through our practices!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.760
Yes.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.100
Okay, president, that thing.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.930
Oh, right.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.770
Okay, everyone, please join me.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.890
Go, Kitauji!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.830
Myoujou's playing "Polovtsian Dances."

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.170
Mizore...

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.130
Break a leg on the solo.

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.770
I'm going to play for you.

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:28.540
Kumiko, I think I'll play for you.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.150
Shouldn't you play for Taki-sensei?

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.470
Are you sure?

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:35.270
It'll end up a stuffy, overheated ballad.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:38.040
That would be a problem...

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.320
It'd be a whole other piece.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.530
Right?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.530
So I'm going to play for you.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:45.490
I look forward to it, then.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:46.700
Watch me.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:50.040
I'll make sure none of the other 
solos even come close.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.260
Please and thank you.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.810
Myoujou is so good.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:57.660
Yeah.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:01.510
Who's the idiot who said they suck now, 
after getting a new adviser?

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.220
Yuko-chan...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.010
Yes?

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:07.600
Going forward, take care of the club.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:12.280
Thanks for putting up with me, guys.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:14.320
That isn't right, Kaori-senpai!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.190
We aren't done yet.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.990
We're aiming for the Nationals.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.840
We're going to the Nationals together!

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.500
Kaori?

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.790
Let's go...

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.460
To the Nationals. Together.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.860
Number sixteen.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.850
Representing Kyoto,
Kitauji High School Concert Band.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:20.400
<b>Kansai Concert Band Competition</b>

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.750
<b>All together!</b>

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.760
<b>Sapphire-chan</b>

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.920
<b>Go!! 
Nationals</b>

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:29.480
<b>Kansai Concert Band Competition</b>

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:29.100
Number fourteen, representing Nara Prefecture.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:31.520
<b>Kansai Concert Band Competition</b>

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:31.170
Hanasaki Girls' High School.

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:32.370
Silver.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:37.950
Number fifteen, representing Osaka.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:39.770
<b>Kansai Concert Band Competition</b>

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:39.770
Myoujou Technical High School.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.460
Gold.

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:44.130
We're next.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:44.900
Right.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.160
<b>Kansai Concert Band Competition</b>

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:48.160
Number sixteen, representing Kyoto.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.880
Kitauji High School.

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:51.190
Gold.

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:05.520
And next,

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:09.850
I shall announce the three schools moving on 
to represent Kansai in the Nationals.

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:17.610
Number three, representing Osaka, 
Osaka Toushou High School.

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:25.570
Number fifteen, representing Osaka, 
Myoujou Technical High School.

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:29.770
Natsuki-senpai, there's only one left!

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:31.330
D-Don't worry.

00:22:35.530 --> 00:22:37.080
Finally...

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:43.710
Number sixteen, representing Kyoto, 
Kitauji High School.

00:22:47.320 --> 00:22:48.220
All right!

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:52.720
Thank you!

00:23:03.970 --> 00:23:05.990
We did it, Reina.

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:13.370
Senpai...

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:16.870
Do you still hate competitions?

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.790
As of now, I love them.

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>To Be Continued</b>
